================================================================================
TRAINED MODEL WEIGHTS — weights/
================================================================================

The checkpoints under `weights/` (notably `weights/driftsense.pt` and
`weights/driftsense_p3.pt`) were trained exclusively on synthetic data produced
by the generator described above. Their redistribution terms inherit whatever
that upstream tree's terms turn out to be. No fab-owned, customer-owned or
otherwise proprietary layout data was used in training; see TRAINING.md.


